[{"id":"bb57e671-236a-40b5-bb50-aaa198f72c72","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>In a contract, “The contractor shall complete the works by 30 June” means…</p>","answers":[{"id":"2ca57296-994b-4326-aa9e-52239a2c9478","title":"<p>it is a legal obligation</p>","correct":true},{"id":"11be2374-6247-4b76-9974-33044f06862b","title":"<p>it is a polite suggestion</p>","correct":false},{"id":"8e48a45d-89cb-4a83-9501-f55ab8be1f57","title":"<p>it is the contractor's choice</p>","correct":false},{"id":"b0140ad5-84ea-4888-8243-e67c34ceafb9","title":"<p>it is old-fashioned English with no meaning</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"2ca57296-994b-4326-aa9e-52239a2c9478","corrects":["2ca57296-994b-4326-aa9e-52239a2c9478"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"2c5e42a5-ceb4-45ea-96df-23967b6ca184","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>Who may instruct a variation under the contract?</p>","answers":[{"id":"9e663acd-bd20-41ab-83e1-0dd5ad92470f","title":"<p>Only the engineer, in writing</p>","correct":true},{"id":"522c6b7a-03a1-4216-aac6-b26d654fd2e6","title":"<p>The client, by phone</p>","correct":false},{"id":"2175cc0f-3f96-49b1-8931-5c4f24f33efb","title":"<p>Any site engineer</p>","correct":false},{"id":"a127daa1-0c70-4685-9eaa-e5555df5df1f","title":"<p>The supplier</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"9e663acd-bd20-41ab-83e1-0dd5ad92470f","corrects":["9e663acd-bd20-41ab-83e1-0dd5ad92470f"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"e69fa030-769e-4c75-aae0-8fe808ed0d90","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>“The employer is entitled to hold 5% retention” means the employer…</p>","answers":[{"id":"a35fded9-3c48-4ccc-b574-cd2b9acd8e4d","title":"<p>has the right to hold it</p>","correct":true},{"id":"e462881e-0623-4385-8692-4a79c8006bec","title":"<p>must never hold it</p>","correct":false},{"id":"00cd97fa-ac7b-4eae-a05c-f62d8ef03817","title":"<p>is forced to pay it back weekly</p>","correct":false},{"id":"411f04a9-e2d9-4a87-a63f-4a5981a81c1b","title":"<p>is responsible for spending it</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"a35fded9-3c48-4ccc-b574-cd2b9acd8e4d","corrects":["a35fded9-3c48-4ccc-b574-cd2b9acd8e4d"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"685e620e-fb54-4fb2-aef1-f2c8beb86d01","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>A variation adds $3,360 and omits $800 of work. The net change to the contract sum is…</p>","answers":[{"id":"587a9715-c0d4-414c-a893-6ae43d6522ff","title":"<p>an addition of $2,560</p>","correct":true},{"id":"efcf3ded-cebf-4a88-ae2a-e26c31c88bcc","title":"<p>an addition of $4,160</p>","correct":false},{"id":"a86ede5f-2543-46a0-9f29-cf17fc4c580a","title":"<p>an omission of $2,560</p>","correct":false},{"id":"c2b74f21-e080-40fd-b143-0f3623b857d5","title":"<p>zero</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"587a9715-c0d4-414c-a893-6ae43d6522ff","corrects":["587a9715-c0d4-414c-a893-6ae43d6522ff"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"e7695508-6437-4542-972b-9e8c3d023873","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>A variation's work is NOT on the critical path. Its five-day time impact…</p>","answers":[{"id":"10967993-76d9-40f6-8482-ab177f0bf38a","title":"<p>does not move the completion date</p>","correct":true},{"id":"a643e28d-35e0-46ce-a496-018a236626cd","title":"<p>moves the completion date five days</p>","correct":false},{"id":"4b29c33c-767d-406d-8675-b58f813418a8","title":"<p>cancels the contract</p>","correct":false},{"id":"8bc708ce-7323-4fa4-b32e-d714825ad734","title":"<p>doubles the price</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"10967993-76d9-40f6-8482-ab177f0bf38a","corrects":["10967993-76d9-40f6-8482-ab177f0bf38a"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"36f52653-ffee-4db4-a3df-f68ea408b954","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>Choose the correct sentence about a change that is not yet agreed.</p>","answers":[{"id":"f5a88bed-9330-49a3-a8d6-bf567d6714a8","title":"<p>The canopy would cost 3,360 dollars.</p>","correct":true},{"id":"cc3186d9-2492-4d2e-ba6b-59dc27bcf245","title":"<p>The canopy will costed 3,360 dollars.</p>","correct":false},{"id":"2e641cf2-9c9a-4c3b-8c8c-5524fd6f2ca0","title":"<p>The canopy costs would 3,360 dollars.</p>","correct":false},{"id":"392a5da0-a428-4a7e-b37b-dc7ade2fa301","title":"<p>The canopy is cost 3,360 dollars.</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"f5a88bed-9330-49a3-a8d6-bf567d6714a8","corrects":["f5a88bed-9330-49a3-a8d6-bf567d6714a8"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"e5c526fa-3aee-4237-83b6-31f8cd8877a2","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>The certified amount is $580,000 and retention is 5%. The amount payable is…</p>","answers":[{"id":"dcf2458b-0b84-48f7-a2c2-12275b014503","title":"<p>$551,000</p>","correct":true},{"id":"44234523-bf8c-498f-8a1d-507b656166d6","title":"<p>$580,000</p>","correct":false},{"id":"75fa4a57-7810-4510-bca9-50b9a710bd5c","title":"<p>$600,000</p>","correct":false},{"id":"213beb5d-3da3-4bb8-a520-ff5e1e4aeb6d","title":"<p>$29,000</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"dcf2458b-0b84-48f7-a2c2-12275b014503","corrects":["dcf2458b-0b84-48f7-a2c2-12275b014503"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"2a8ee608-068c-4526-b290-a9e8d53acbaf","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>Put the payment cycle in the correct order.</p>","answers":[{"id":"b5f7571a-3887-42a0-aacd-5feafe49feeb","title":"<p>application → certificate → payment</p>","correct":true},{"id":"a3b08ba5-01d7-48ce-b7bc-adc1c3ed5dd4","title":"<p>payment → application → certificate</p>","correct":false},{"id":"6c9124fa-4a4e-44ea-b548-0ffa65572161","title":"<p>certificate → payment → application</p>","correct":false},{"id":"a0098942-ab90-4c38-a734-db030575ed00","title":"<p>application → payment → certificate</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"b5f7571a-3887-42a0-aacd-5feafe49feeb","corrects":["b5f7571a-3887-42a0-aacd-5feafe49feeb"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"c0c8e120-0f01-48e2-9759-f5be133b57b7","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>A delay of 6 days hits an activity with 10 days of float. The extension of time due is…</p>","answers":[{"id":"4e1fc1dc-1908-4676-9804-7a1e948db5a2","title":"<p>zero – the float absorbs the delay</p>","correct":true},{"id":"83f1b990-838f-4ee9-aab4-c558f9c6fe6d","title":"<p>6 days</p>","correct":false},{"id":"ad0ca06b-a9b5-4600-9dd4-a6fea99afab2","title":"<p>10 days</p>","correct":false},{"id":"87b6bd92-1002-42de-926e-fbc7d4bed2cc","title":"<p>4 days</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"4e1fc1dc-1908-4676-9804-7a1e948db5a2","corrects":["4e1fc1dc-1908-4676-9804-7a1e948db5a2"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"47ed45de-d768-4000-9da3-1d33a2b4b67a","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>What must the contractor usually do within 14 days of a delay event?</p>","answers":[{"id":"fe5ad821-cbe0-4f6f-8ac7-c72299497bbe","title":"<p>Give notice to the engineer</p>","correct":true},{"id":"99169c84-9adf-437c-aa3e-8c1cb5e30ec7","title":"<p>Stop all work</p>","correct":false},{"id":"7dac9106-baae-4a33-8327-5399c32138fc","title":"<p>Pay liquidated damages</p>","correct":false},{"id":"77147086-13fe-48bb-890d-e121deaf86ad","title":"<p>Cancel the programme</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"fe5ad821-cbe0-4f6f-8ac7-c72299497bbe","corrects":["fe5ad821-cbe0-4f6f-8ac7-c72299497bbe"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"7fa17477-1dde-4bd3-8b28-d8f381a62f16","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>The design airflow is 4,500 m³/h with ±10% tolerance. A measured value of 4,350 is…</p>","answers":[{"id":"8b4bea6d-3a89-4801-b297-21c704beb8df","title":"<p>within tolerance – the test is passed</p>","correct":true},{"id":"5c896828-fbbe-488c-a4f0-a3fbd00b54a6","title":"<p>out of tolerance – the test is failed</p>","correct":false},{"id":"bc375d21-95db-4c92-aa08-a9cf20cfbdae","title":"<p>exactly the design value</p>","correct":false},{"id":"e07323cc-7b73-4d81-94ad-7ce19c99a552","title":"<p>impossible</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"8b4bea6d-3a89-4801-b297-21c704beb8df","corrects":["8b4bea6d-3a89-4801-b297-21c704beb8df"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"d8de37d0-5b33-4fc6-80cb-572d7b14410c","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>A measured test result is just below the minimum. The professional action is to…</p>","answers":[{"id":"542a0d7f-b09b-4f28-bef5-ac5b54fa9d4a","title":"<p>record it as failed, correct the cause and retest</p>","correct":true},{"id":"51832161-d181-4824-ae3c-a3c6593cc4fc","title":"<p>round it up to pass</p>","correct":false},{"id":"0a9d746f-68b0-4684-8350-05941da0f11f","title":"<p>change the design value</p>","correct":false},{"id":"1b9070cc-bd7d-49d9-b9a4-8ac6956a787d","title":"<p>sign the certificate anyway</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"542a0d7f-b09b-4f28-bef5-ac5b54fa9d4a","corrects":["542a0d7f-b09b-4f28-bef5-ac5b54fa9d4a"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"bda07ef7-ddfc-4ecb-a6eb-9b2ec16e94f5","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>“The door needs repainting” means…</p>","answers":[{"id":"0c6aa490-8672-4157-9384-b5a880c8bfd9","title":"<p>the door must be repainted</p>","correct":true},{"id":"b57515d2-252f-45db-bdde-4d16c4d4be2d","title":"<p>the door repaints itself</p>","correct":false},{"id":"f64d9139-f9a0-4d0f-a450-95e33d17691e","title":"<p>the painter needs a new door</p>","correct":false},{"id":"22960f8a-c1a4-42a0-bbe8-3554c1040331","title":"<p>the door needed paint long ago</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"0c6aa490-8672-4157-9384-b5a880c8bfd9","corrects":["0c6aa490-8672-4157-9384-b5a880c8bfd9"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"b22889dd-37eb-491c-842b-b029a82da6f6","type":"MULTIPLE_CHOICE","title":"<p>A hidden pipe joint fails two months after handover. This is…</p>","answers":[{"id":"93788e28-790d-49db-ad0a-7afd54c8ce8c","title":"<p>a latent defect – repaired by the contractor under the DLP</p>","correct":true},{"id":"8ae8d2f1-efd9-4d9c-bf81-9ec9958b332a","title":"<p>wear and tear – the client pays</p>","correct":false},{"id":"0327887e-a980-4521-a61c-ef2065130497","title":"<p>a snag that was missed, so nobody repairs it</p>","correct":false},{"id":"450922e6-10f2-4e10-862f-e6c749a1111c","title":"<p>a variation</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","correct":"93788e28-790d-49db-ad0a-7afd54c8ce8c","corrects":["93788e28-790d-49db-ad0a-7afd54c8ce8c"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"3581c7b7-978a-4402-90a9-e2e060f2a31c","type":"MATCHING","title":"<p>Match each document with its purpose.</p>","answers":[{"id":"eafb73c9-4947-4f76-9c79-f25165dde46a","title":"Taking-over certificate","matchTitle":"transfers the building and starts the DLP"},{"id":"1474bd61-a37a-4c2d-8ca4-43c7eebf763a","title":"O&M manuals","matchTitle":"explain how to run and maintain the systems"},{"id":"b99d0995-60ce-4be1-9be6-3c33fe9f0f0f","title":"As-built drawings","matchTitle":"show the building as it was really built"},{"id":"f4c05d09-ac01-4df2-a9be-40a37fe47d0a","title":"Outstanding items list","matchTitle":"names the small works still to be finished"}],"feedback":"","metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null},{"id":"7114bcb1-0241-41ec-a7e2-b1547dd99a6e","type":"MULTIPLE_RESPONSE","title":"<p>What happens when the taking-over certificate is issued? (Choose all that apply.)</p>","answers":[{"id":"5aca16a4-5865-4bbd-8961-f86b96f7bdb2","title":"<p>The defects liability period begins.</p>","correct":true},{"id":"db2b51b3-4245-420a-b920-3be4f71df49d","title":"<p>Half of the retention is released.</p>","correct":true},{"id":"10ec18ec-1bf3-4ef0-a025-3ac4253d7f59","title":"<p>The employer takes beneficial use of the building.</p>","correct":true},{"id":"f1d501d3-10f9-4523-87d1-afc283eeba5a","title":"<p>The contractor's responsibility ends completely.</p>","correct":false},{"id":"96c2fce2-e9f0-4ead-a8b7-77367932f0b5","title":"<p>The snag walk starts.</p>","correct":false}],"feedback":"","corrects":["5aca16a4-5865-4bbd-8961-f86b96f7bdb2","db2b51b3-4245-420a-b920-3be4f71df49d","10ec18ec-1bf3-4ef0-a025-3ac4253d7f59"],"metadata":{},"globalBlockId":null}]